stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending
  pending --> confirmed
  pending --> cancelled
  confirmed --> processing
  confirmed --> cancelled
  processing --> shipping
  processing --> cancelled
  shipping --> delivered
  shipping --> delivery_failed
  delivery_failed --> shipping
  delivery_failed --> returned
  delivered --> completed
  completed --> returned
  note left of cancelled
    Eligible non-COD unpaid orders can transition from pending,
    confirmed, or processing after the configured timeout.
  end note
  note right of shipping
    Admin transitions are confirmed and may include a history note.
    Cancellation requires a reason; COD delivery requires collection confirmation.
    Bank-transfer orders remain unpaid until staff reconcile the bank statement.
    For pickup orders, shipping means ready for store pickup; delivered means handed to the customer. Pickup orders cannot enter delivery_failed.
  end note
  note right of returned
    Return approval alone does not change stock. Staff confirms receipt,
    then transitions delivered/completed orders to returned to restore inventory.
  end note
